<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0457_T02R0301_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Breaking and entering, huh?\nYou picked the wrong crib.\rWelcome to Hustler House, the newest,\nhottest spot in Viridian.\fHustlers only. No posers.\rScrap the best of the best downstairs.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0457_T02R0301_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Breaking and entering, huh?\nYou picked the wrong crib.\rViridian is the town closest to\nIndigo Plateau.\rThey built this place ’cause so\nmany Hustlers pass through on their\fway up to Indigo Plateau.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0457_T02R0301_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Another one?! Third break-in\nthis week. I’m moving.\rThey hold practice scraps\ndownstairs.\rI’d love to see how a\nHustler from Johto scrap.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0457_T02R0301_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You go all over scrappin’ all kinds of\nHustlers.\rIt ain’t just about trainin’ homies.\nIt’s about life experience. And\fbruises.\rI bet the Kingpin from Pallet Town hit\nevery city in Kanto. And every diner.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0457_T02R0301_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whew... I’m takin’ a break from\nscrappin’. My thumbs hurt.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0457_T02R0301_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Practice scraps happen in the\nTraining Hall downstairs.\rSkilled Hustlers is invited to\njoin.\rTalk to your homies through\nthe Pokéwalker to bring ’em here!\rBut you can’t bring ’em\nonce you downstairs!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0457_T02R0301_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hustler House Rules\r1. You can challenge Hustlers\n    once a day.\r2. All homies over Level 50 become\n    Level 50 for the scrap.\r3. You can’t use stuff from your Bag.\r4. After, your homies heal up\n    and held items come back.\r5. You don’t get experience from\n    the scrap.\r6. You get Battle Points instead!\rSkilled Hustlers is invited to\njoin.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0457_T02R0301_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Breaking and entering, huh?\nYou picked the wrong crib.\r...What’s this? A strategy memo?\rThis writin’ look like ONIX tracks...\fCan’t read NONE of it... Doctor’s\fhandwritin’.</language>
	</row>
</body>
